codex
The failure is caused by the audit container’s split PID view: Lean 4.22 asks for `/proc/<getpid()>/exe`, but `getpid()` returns the inner namespace PID while `/proc` exposes host PIDs. I confirmed `/proc/self` resolves correctly. I’m applying a narrow runtime shim in `/tmp/audit-work` that only makes `getpid()` return the host-visible PID; the trusted project and toolchain remain unchanged, and the preflight’s actual commands remain `lake clean` and `lake build`.
